   "source": [
    "# Logistic Regression & the XOR Problem\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Logistic regression** - one sigmoid neuron separates two linearly separable classes\n",
    "2. **XOR** - not linearly separable, so a **hidden layer** is needed\n",
    "\n",
    "Both use **binary cross-entropy**, the natural loss for sigmoid outputs."
   ]
  }
 ],
